ildren":["費用はかかりません。難しいのは、自分自身が疲れ果て、怒りに震えている時に手を止めることです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["赤ちゃんの頭部は占める割合が大きく、頸部の筋肉は弱いです。激しく揺さぶると、頭蓋内出血や網膜出血（脳や目の中の出血）を引き起こし、死に至ることもあれば、生涯にわたる障害を残すこともあります。寝かしつけ時の穏やかな揺れは含まれず、危険なのは制御不能な激しい揺さぶりです。医学的には、揺さぶりや衝撃によって引き起こされるこの種の損傷を「揺さぶりによる小児頭部外傷（Abusive Head Trauma）」と呼びます。これは 2 歳以下の子供の頭部外傷による死亡の主要な原因です。アメリカでは 1999 年から 2014 年の間に、2250 名近い 5 歳以下の子供の死亡を引き起こしました。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Spies EL, Klevens J (2016). Fatal Abusive Head Trauma Among Children Aged <5 Years — United States, 1999–2014. MMWR 65(20):505-509. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm6520a1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm6520a1"]},"；Choudhary AK 等 (2018). Consensus statement on abusive head trauma in infants and young children. Pediatric Radiology 48(8):1048-1065. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00247-018-4149-1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s00247-018-4149-1"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.15585/mmwr.mm6520a1","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["もし本当に感情を抑えきれなくなりそうな瞬間が来たら、まずは赤ちゃんをベビーベッドに戻し、その場を数分間離れてください。抱っこして揺らすよりも、しばらく泣かせておく方がはるかに安全です。一人で育児をしている方や、長期的な睡眠不足に陥っている方は、このことを最も肝に銘じてください。自身の感情のコントロール方法については、第 3 節を参照してください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"3ヶ月未満の乳児は、体温が 38 ℃ に達したら、自宅で様子を見ず、すぐに病院へ行ってください"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/20-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"おむつ選びはブランドではなく3つのポイントを見る：サイズ感、交換頻度、抜き打ち検査の通知歴"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"li